A 400x200 px horizontal tech tree background image for "Warrior Code" in a Civ-like strategy game. The style is Ancient Greek, moderately realistic but clearly animated game art. The composition is a tight, low-angle cinematic close-up of a Hoplite Phalanx formation. The focus is on three elite warrior nobles locked tightly together, their large bronze Hoplon shields overlapping perfectly. You can see the gleaming bronze crests of their Corinthian helmets and the tips of their long dory spears pointing forward. The image powerfully conveys intense martial discipline, uniform, and collective honor, with zero focus on law or civil elements.


To make the phalanx work for a small 400x200 px tech tree card, the artwork should focus on a tight, cinematic close-up of the interlocking shields rather than a wide shot of an entire army. This preserves the detail of the elite armor and uniform while clearly showing the formation.


